{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14813","headline":"和王员外冬夜寓直 · 卢纶","name":"和王员外冬夜寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高步长裾锦帐郎，居然自是汉贤良。\n潘岳叙年因鬓发，扬雄托谏在文章。\n九天韶乐飘寒月，万户香尘裛晓霜。\n坐见重门俨朝骑，可怜云路独翺翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}